    width: 67.74%; border-bottom:  1px solid #e7e7e7;">				
					
							
					
					<h5 style =" margin:20px;  opacity: .5;">
 &nbsp; A convenient online speech synthesizer (text-to-speech) is suitable for converting any text into an audio track. The built-in algorithm takes into account all the features of live speech: intonation, amplitude, language nuances. The result is beautiful audio that is voiced by a male or female voice. A large number of languages ​​are available. Online voice acting of the text does not resemble the monotonous speech of a robot or bot, but is very similar to the one read by the announcer.<br>

&nbsp; A good voice service is useful in the information sphere, when creating technology and programming voice alerts and commands, in advertising and for various content. High-quality audio tracks will replace a live announcer in videos for social networks, a lecturer, a seminar leader.<br>

&nbsp; The program works without additional settings and requirements, it runs even on a weak computer. Read text up to 30,000 characters long. The service is absolutely free. If you use the results in any public material, please indicate below where you created this speech. Thank you.<br>

Service functionality:<br>
&nbsp; The speech synthesizer makes it possible to play or save the received audio. The finished file in .mp3 format is played in any regular player of the PC operating system or mobile device. Decent quality of text voice acting allows you to use the track without additional processing.
You can adjust the speed, pitch and pauses between sentences and paragraphs.<br>

&nbsp; You can clear the text input field or make changes at any time.
The service provides the ability to voice the text in English, French, Spanish, Portuguese, Italian, German, Russian, Norwegian, Danish, Turkish, Icelandic, Swedish or Polish;<br><br>

&nbsp; Discover the Power of Text-to-Speech<br><br>

&nbsp; Enrich your online courses with engaging stories using our free TTS service. Clear, friendly female voices enhance the learning experience by easily guiding students through lessons and tutorials.
<br>
&nbsp; Develop interactive storytelling apps with engaging narration using our free TTS service. Bring characters to life with authentic female voices, captivating young readers and enhancing their storytelling experience.
<br>
&nbsp; Improve customer satisfaction with friendly voice messages using our free TTS service's text-to-speech feature. Create welcome and informational messages for automated phone systems, guiding callers through menus and providing assistance with ease.
<br>
&nbsp; Using our text-to-speech software, you can create audiobooks with compelling female narration. Eloquent voices bring literary works to life, enriching the listening experience for book lovers of all ages.
<br>
&nbsp; Enhance your language learning apps with authentic pronunciation guides using our free TTS service's text to speech. Helps users master new languages ​​by providing a clear, precise female voice to repeat words and phrases.
<br>
&nbsp; Host podcasts with dynamic female stories using our text to speech feature. Engage listeners with interesting stories, discussions, and interviews, creating a captivating audio experience that will keep aud<br>iences coming back for more.
<br>
